OL,3,GNEWSACarla Lockhart denies 'simply
OL,4,Asatisfying hardliners' over Drumcree
OL,5,Astance
OL,6,
OL,7,FCarla Lockhart has written a post on
OL,8,Fsocial media outlining the reasons for
OL,9,Fher decision to stand down as party
OL,10,Fofficer for the Democratic Unionist
OL,11,FParty (DUP).
OL,13,FOn Thursday, the MP said she could not
OL,14,F"continue to be part of the team that
OL,15,Fdecide on the direction and strategy
OL,16,Fdiscussions of the party" as party
OL,17,Fleader Gavin Robinson has so far ruled
OL,18,Fout removing Emma Little-Pengelly as
OL,19,Fdeputy first minister.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
