OL,3,GNEWSACarla Lockhart denies 'simply
OL,4,Asatisfying hardliners' over Drumcree
OL,5,Astance
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere have been differences of opinion
OL,8,Fwithin the DUP over how to deal with
OL,9,Fthe fallout of the Drumcree dispute.
OL,11,FLockhart has called for
OL,12,FLittle-Pengelly's removal due to First
OL,13,FMinister Michelle O'Neill's attendance
OL,14,Fat a Garvaghy Road protest.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
